{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "e17a1299-9e21-8adb-bb64-162c11f315e4",
  "created_at": "2026-03-09T09:58:24-04:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Terrence Donovan",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Owen Haskell",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T09:56:53-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Owen. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T09:56:57-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, I'm looking for the state tax division. Is this them? Bottom line first."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T09:57:02-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, no, sir. This is the City Clerk's office, City of Newport. The state tax division is a separate office, run by the state."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T09:57:11-04:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Huh. I dialed the number off a letter. Thought I got it right. [pause] Hang on, let me set this down. I've got a bag of potting soil I'm carrying up to the front steps."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T09:57:23-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T09:57:25-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Back. So what's the deal, is it the area code? I figured 401 covers the whole state."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T09:57:32-04:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It does, the whole state is 401. So the area code isn't the problem. The rest of the number would just belong to a different office. Newport city offices and state offices have their own numbers."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T09:57:44-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So I've got a digit wrong, then."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T09:57:47-04:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Likely so, or the letter lists a different number than the one you dialed. I'd read it over again carefully. If you can't find it, the state's Division of Taxation has its own website and a main line. A search for Rhode Island Division of Taxation should bring it right up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T09:58:04-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. I'll look at the letter again and search it. Not a city matter, then."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T09:58:10-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right, not ours. Sorry I can't point you straight to them."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T09:58:15-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's fine. That's what I needed to know. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T09:58:19-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T09:58:22-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too."
    }
  ],
